# .env is COMMITTED on purpose — Lovable requires it for build-time VITE_*
# values, and it only ever contains public, RLS-protected values (never a
# service role key or third-party API key). Real secrets live in Lovable's
# Cloud tab -> Secrets, not in this repo at all.
# .env.local is a local-dev-only fallback for engineers running the app
# outside Lovable, and stays ignored since people sometimes paste real
# secrets into it out of habit.

